Package: showkitr
Title: Before/After Showcase Cards for Function Calls
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("David", "Brocker", email = "davidabrocker@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Two tools for teaching and sharing R functions. fx_showcase()
    runs a function call, captures its before/after state, and composites a
    styled before/after image for sharing (e.g. "function of the day" posts);
    an RStudio Addin wraps a selected call with it in place. fx_glossary()
    and fx_glossary_page() turn a function's help page into student-friendly
    glossary cards (arguments, defaults, plain-language descriptions) as
    standalone HTML, with optional hand-written wording from a YAML file.
